nodes.statement_en:
Let $a_n$ be a nonnegative nonincreasing real sequence, and suppose the series $\sum_{n\geq 1} a_n$ diverges. Then the series $\sum_{n\geq 1} \min\{a_n,1/n^p\}$ satisfies:
1. it diverges for $0<p\leq 1$;
2. it converges for $p>1$.

